commit 69dc190d35803a38f38032113445f650b26fc18f
cli/neo: suppress console URL in --print mode

Print mode is for piping to other agents/scripts that read both stdout
and stderr; the URL is noise in that context. Keep it on stderr in the
plain no-TTY path.

